@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ArrowColor #C62828
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C62828
skinparam ArrowThickness 2

title Remove a student's attendance
participant "Unmark command" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "Pending model" as Model MODEL_COLOR

[-> Command : Remove attendance entry
activate Command

Command -> Model : Read all students
Model --> Command : Student list
Command -> Command : Find student by ID
Command -> Command : Read this student's attendance records
Command -> Command : Find record matching date and group
Command -> Command : Remove it from a copy of the attendance set
note over Command
A student stores their own attendance
records across tutorial groups.
Current group membership is not required.
Keep other details and attendance records.
end note
Command -> Model : Replace the student's record

[<-- Command : Unmark result
deactivate Command
@enduml
